--[[
    SIMPLE HUB | FORSAKEN | 3-LAYER AUTO BLOCK

    Load the COMPLETE SkidSaken v1.7 core first, then execute this add-on.

    Layer 1: SkidSaken's native hitbox/attribute detector.
    Layer 2: Duck Hub-style oriented box overlap detector (ported from the
             supplied deobfuscated source; no broken loader/deobfuscated locals).
    Layer 3: killer-name filtered sound + animation cue watcher.

    This file is an add-on, not a standalone replacement for SkidSaken.
    First trigger is immediate. A confirmation sound suppresses the retry;
    otherwise one short failover attempt is made.
]]

